  "attack": {
    "name": "Psyshkhwe Arietta",
    "description": "<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Normal Attack</span>\nSings an ancient song of the Water Imps, unleashing up to 4 strikes. This deals <span style=\"color: #80C0FFFF;\">Hydro DMG</span> to the opponent.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Charged Attack</span>\nConsumes a certain amount of Stamina to hurl a water ball forward, dealing <span style=\"color: #80C0FFFF;\">Hydro DMG</span>.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Plunging Attack</span>\nPlunges towards the ground from mid-air, damaging all opponents along the path. Deals <span style=\"color: #80C0FFFF;\">AoE Hydro DMG</span> upon impact with the ground.",
